@GatewayApi = http://localhost:5037
@Name = Lan

### Test shared and gateway localization in Vietnamese, including formatted values
GET {{GatewayApi}}/api/test/localization?culture=vi&ui-culture=vi&name={{Name}}
Accept: application/json

### Test shared and gateway localization in English, including formatted values
GET {{GatewayApi}}/api/test/localization?culture=en&ui-culture=en&name={{Name}}
Accept: application/json

### Test request culture selection with the Accept-Language header
GET {{GatewayApi}}/api/test/localization?name={{Name}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: vi